{"id":"n16608-2-7","stage":5,"title":"서민 · 平民","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16608-2-7-1","ko":"집이 없는 서민들의 한을 상류층이 이해하기는 힘들어.","zh":"没有房子的普通人的苦衷，上层阶级是很难理解的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집이","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집이","audio":"/audio/0f403a24bdd427c70421.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"8","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는","audio":"/audio/9064a5c0bfdea4101ee3.mp3"}},{"text":"서민들의","meaning":"平民","explanation":"서민：平民；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"서민","audio":"/audio/88873696e7d61f0a2d25.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16608","senseId":"2","lemma":"서민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서민들의","audio":"/audio/cd80b54ec1ce2f6ef947.mp3"}},{"text":"한을","meaning":"恨","explanation":"한：恨；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84550","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한을","audio":"/audio/1243e17c33277d65733b.mp3"}},{"text":"상류층이","meaning":"上流层","explanation":"상류층：上流层；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"상류층","audio":"/audio/9a4e9edc3cc056d4a0f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61705","senseId":"1","lemma":"상류층","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상류층이","audio":"/audio/25fd6c6900986dfb2421.mp3"}},{"text":"이해하기는","meaning":"理解","explanation":"이해하다：理解；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이해하다","audio":"/audio/fc001754fa34535b35d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69534","sen